{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Physics｜结构图\n物理材质只提供表面语义。[[Physics/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPhysicalMaterialWithTags\n继承 UPhysicalMaterial。\n`Tags: FGameplayTagContainer` → 标记 Metal/Flesh 等表面类型。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FHitResult.PhysMaterial\n近战或其他碰撞结果携带材质资产；普通材质没有项目 Tags。[[Combat/结构]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility / GE / Cue\n`BuildHitEffectPayload()` 把材质 Tag 同时并入目标 Spec Tag 与 Cue 目标 Tag。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## DamageExecution / HitImpact Cue\n按表面 Tag 选择衰减或表现；具体规则属于 [[AbilitySystem/结构]]。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 物理材质语义传递\nMeleeTrace::PerformTrace 用 bReturnPhysicalMaterial 查询 → FHitResult.PhysMaterial → UGGYGOPhysicalMaterialWithTags::Tags。\nPlayerCombo 与 BossMelee 都走 BuildHitEffectPayload：表面 Tag 进入 GE 目标 Spec Tag 和 Cue 目标 Tag；DamageExecution 从 EffectContext.PhysicalMaterial 调 AbilitySource 衰减接口。\n普通 UPhysicalMaterial 不含项目 Tags，链路按无表面语义处理；Physics 不负责直接扣血。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "asset",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "hit",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "碰撞体使用此材质"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "hit",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "ge",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "命中结果中的 PhysMaterial"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "ge",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "cue",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "GE 目标 Tag 提供表面语义"
    }
  ]
}
